  "body": "\n\n<section class=\"page-hero\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    \n<nav class=\"crumbs\" aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\">\n  <ol>\n    <li><a href=\"index.html\">Home</a></li>\n    <li><a href=\"about.html\">Company</a></li><li><span aria-current=\"page\">Careers</span></li>\n  </ol>\n</nav>\n    <div class=\"page-hero-side\" style=\"margin-top:1.5rem\">\n      <div>\n        \n        <p class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"margin-bottom:1rem\">Careers</p>\n        <h1>Small team, published salaries, unglamorous problems.</h1>\n        <p class=\"lede\">We are building distribution infrastructure and editing other people's news. Both require people who care about details that nobody notices when they are right.</p>\n        <div class=\"hero-actions\"><a class=\"btn\" href=\"mailto:careers@presscosmos.com\">Send an application</a></div>\n      </div>\n      \n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n\n<section class=\"section section-tight pt-0\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    \n    \n<div class=\"callout callout-answer\" data-reveal>\n  <strong>Quick answer</strong>\n  PressCosmos is a remote-first company headquartered in San Francisco. Every open role lists a published salary range. We hire across editorial, distribution operations, search and AI engineering, and customer success, with an interview process of four stages completed inside three weeks.\n</div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n\n<section class=\"section \">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"section-head \" data-reveal>\n      <p class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"margin-bottom:1rem\">Open roles</p>\n      <h2>Currently hiring</h2>\n      \n    </div>\n    <div class=\"stack\" style=\"--flow:0\">\n    <article class=\"release-row\">\n      <div><p class=\"where\">Editorial</p><p class=\"mono faint\" style=\"margin-top:.35rem\">Remote (US/EU)</p></div>\n      <div>\n        <h3 style=\"font-size:var(--step-1)\">Senior Editor — Financial Services</h3>\n        <p class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:.4rem;font-size:var(--step--1)\">Own review quality for the finance vertical, and maintain the substantiation standards that decide whether a release goes out.</p>\n        <p class=\"mono\" style=\"margin-top:.5rem;color:var(--lime)\">$105,000 – $128,000</p>\n      </div>\n      <a class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-sm\" href=\"mailto:careers@presscosmos.com?subject=Application: Senior%20Editor%20%E2%80%94%20Financial%20Services\">Apply</a>\n    </article><article class=\"release-row\">\n      <div><p class=\"where\">Operations</p><p class=\"mono faint\" style=\"margin-top:.35rem\">Remote (US)</p></div>\n      <div>\n        <h3 style=\"font-size:var(--step-1)\">Distribution Operations Manager</h3>\n        <p class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:.4rem;font-size:var(--step--1)\">Maintain partner relationships, monitor lane health, and own the disposition of any delivery failure.</p>\n        <p class=\"mono\" style=\"margin-top:.5rem;color:var(--lime)\">$92,000 – $115,000</p>\n      </div>\n      <a class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-sm\" href=\"mailto:careers@presscosmos.com?subject=Application: Distribution%20Operations%20Manager\">Apply</a>\n    </article><article class=\"release-row\">\n      <div><p class=\"where\">Engineering</p><p class=\"mono faint\" style=\"margin-top:.35rem\">Remote (EU/US)</p></div>\n      <div>\n        <h3 style=\"font-size:var(--step-1)\">Search & AI Engineer</h3>\n        <p class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:.4rem;font-size:var(--step--1)\">Build the entity graph, structured-data pipeline and share-of-answer measurement across nine engines.</p>\n        <p class=\"mono\" style=\"margin-top:.5rem;color:var(--lime)\">$140,000 – $175,000</p>\n      </div>\n      <a class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-sm\" href=\"mailto:careers@presscosmos.com?subject=Application: Search%20%26%20AI%20Engineer\">Apply</a>\n    </article><article class=\"release-row\">\n      <div><p class=\"where\">Success</p><p class=\"mono faint\" style=\"margin-top:.35rem\">San Francisco or remote (US)</p></div>\n      <div>\n        <h3 style=\"font-size:var(--step-1)\">Customer Success Lead</h3>\n        <p class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:.4rem;font-size:var(--step--1)\">Own onboarding and retention for Studio and enterprise accounts, including quarterly reporting reviews.</p>\n        <p class=\"mono\" style=\"margin-top:.5rem;color:var(--lime)\">$98,000 – $122,000</p>\n      </div>\n      <a class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-sm\" href=\"mailto:careers@presscosmos.com?subject=Application: Customer%20Success%20Lead\">Apply</a>\n    </article>\n  </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n\n<section class=\"section \">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"section-head \" data-reveal>\n      <p class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"margin-bottom:1rem\">Process</p>\n      <h2>How hiring works here</h2>\n      \n    </div>\n    <ol class=\"grid g-4\" data-stagger>\n    <li class=\"card spotlight\"><p class=\"mono gradient-text\" style=\"font-size:var(--step-2);font-weight:700\">01</p><h3 style=\"margin-top:.5rem\">Application review</h3><p>A human reads every application. You get a decision either way within five business days.</p></li><li class=\"card spotlight\"><p class=\"mono gradient-text\" style=\"font-size:var(--step-2);font-weight:700\">02</p><h3 style=\"margin-top:.5rem\">Craft conversation</h3><p>Forty-five minutes with the hiring manager on how you actually work.</p></li><li class=\"card spotlight\"><p class=\"mono gradient-text\" style=\"font-size:var(--step-2);font-weight:700\">03</p><h3 style=\"margin-top:.5rem\">Practical exercise</h3><p>A paid, time-boxed exercise based on a real problem. Never free spec work.</p></li><li class=\"card spotlight\"><p class=\"mono gradient-text\" style=\"font-size:var(--step-2);font-weight:700\">04</p><h3 style=\"margin-top:.5rem\">Team and offer</h3><p>Two conversations with the people you would work with, then a decision within three days.</p></li>\n  </ol>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n\n<section class=\"section \">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"section-head \" data-reveal>\n      <p class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"margin-bottom:1rem\">Benefits</p>\n      <h2>What we offer</h2>\n      \n    </div>\n    <div class=\"grid g-3\">\n    \n<article class=\"card spotlight\" data-reveal>\n  \n  <div class=\"card-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m12 3.5 2.7 5.6 6.1.9-4.4 4.3 1 6.1-5.4-2.9-5.4 2.9 1-6.1L3.2 10l6.1-.9z\"/></svg></div>\n  <h3>Published salary bands</h3>\n  <p>Every role has a range in the advert. No negotiation lottery based on who asks hardest.</p>\n  \n  \n</article>\n<article class=\"card spotlight\" data-reveal>\n  \n  <div class=\"card-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m12 3.5 2.7 5.6 6.1.9-4.4 4.3 1 6.1-5.4-2.9-5.4 2.9 1-6.1L3.2 10l6.1-.9z\"/></svg></div>\n  <h3>Four-day publishing weeks in August</h3>\n  <p>Editorial runs a reduced schedule for one month a year, fully paid.</p>\n  \n  \n</article>\n<article class=\"card spotlight\" data-reveal>\n  \n  <div class=\"card-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m12 3.5 2.7 5.6 6.1.9-4.4 4.3 1 6.1-5.4-2.9-5.4 2.9 1-6.1L3.2 10l6.1-.9z\"/></svg></div>\n  <h3>Remote-first with a real office</h3>\n  <p>Work where you like; the San Francisco office exists for the people who want it.</p>\n  \n  \n</article>\n<article class=\"card spotlight\" data-reveal>\n  \n  <div class=\"card-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m12 3.5 2.7 5.6 6.1.9-4.4 4.3 1 6.1-5.4-2.9-5.4 2.9 1-6.1L3.2 10l6.1-.9z\"/></svg></div>\n  <h3>Health, dental and vision</h3>\n  <p>Employer-funded for you and dependants in the US; equivalent stipend elsewhere.</p>\n  \n  \n</article>\n<article class=\"card spotlight\" data-reveal>\n  \n  <div class=\"card-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m12 3.5 2.7 5.6 6.1.9-4.4 4.3 1 6.1-5.4-2.9-5.4 2.9 1-6.1L3.2 10l6.1-.9z\"/></svg></div>\n  <h3>Learning budget</h3>\n  <p>$2,500 per year for conferences, courses and books, no approval theatre.</p>\n  \n  \n</article>\n<article class=\"card spotlight\" data-reveal>\n  \n  <div class=\"card-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m12 3.5 2.7 5.6 6.1.9-4.4 4.3 1 6.1-5.4-2.9-5.4 2.9 1-6.1L3.2 10l6.1-.9z\"/></svg></div>\n  <h3>Parental leave</h3>\n  <p>Sixteen weeks at full pay for all parents, from day one of employment.</p>\n  \n  \n</article>\n  </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n\n<section class=\"section\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"cta-band\" data-reveal>\n      <p class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"justify-content:center;display:inline-flex\">Get started</p>\n      <h2 style=\"margin-top:1rem\">Do not see your role?</h2>\n      <p class=\"lede mx-auto\" style=\"margin-top:1rem;max-width:60ch\">If you have run a newsroom, a wire desk or a retrieval pipeline and you think we are doing something wrong, tell us. We read every message.</p>\n      <div class=\"hero-actions\" style=\"justify-content:center\">\n        <a class=\"btn btn-lg\" href=\"mailto:careers@presscosmos.com\">Email careers@presscosmos.com</a>\n        <a class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-lg\" href=\"about.html\">About PressCosmos</a>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"mono faint mt-3\">No subscription required · Cancel anytime · Human editorial review on every release</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>",
  "priority": 0.5
}
